  "body": "It appears that Synapse will, if no filter is specified on a `/sync` request, default to some sort of internal filter with a limit of 10 events per room timeline.\r\n\r\nThe spec, however, *implies* that `limited` will only be `true` if a filter is specified, through the following passage:\r\n\r\n> True if the number of events returned was limited by the `limit` on the filter.\r\n\r\n... but never explicitly says whether not specifying a `filter` should mean that there is no limit, or some sort of default limit.",
